 "brief": "Israeli security expert Firas Yaghi told Shehab Wire that Friday's assassination in Jenin reflects an Israeli policy of escalation across the West Bank. According to Yaghi, Israel's military and security establishment is operating under significant political pressure to intensify operations in the territory on a substantial scale.\n\nYaghi characterized the killing as part of a broader pattern rather than an isolated incident, arguing it demonstrates the scope of Israeli military action in the region. He said Palestinians need to develop a comprehensive program capable of confronting both occupation and settlement expansion as a response to the escalating violence.",
